{"id":"n75236-1-4","stage":3,"title":"조 · 兆","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75236-1-4-1","ko":"김 회장이 대단한 부자라면서?","zh":"听说金会长是个非常有钱的人吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"회장이","meaning":"会长，董事长","explanation":"회장：会长，董事长；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"회장","audio":"/audio/7c0848a40e52a247a47b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62408","senseId":"2","lemma":"회장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회장이","audio":"/audio/7afcefa3f72dcec72d16.mp3"}},{"text":"대단한","meaning":"很出色，很杰出","explanation":"대단하다：很出色，很杰出；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대단하다","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46607","senseId":"3","lemma":"대단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대단한","audio":"/audio/ef0d9ec5963b3d16f4cf.mp3"}},{"text":"부자라면서?","meaning":"富翁，富豪，富人","explanation":"부자：富翁，富豪，富人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라면서：引用听来的名词判断或命令，向对方确认；加 요 更礼貌。","readings":[{"term":"부자","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59725","senseId":"1","lemma":"부자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부자라면서","audio":"/audio/72d4dfa5200131341802.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7c0848a40e52a247","term":"회장","zh":"会长，董事长","audio":"/audio/7c0848a40e52a247a47b.mp3","entryId":"62408","definition":"代表公司并对其负责的最高职位；或指在该职位上的人。","pronunciation":["회ː장","훼ː장"]},{"id":"a89a72f50dfdf2da","term":"대단하다","zh":"很出色，很杰出","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3","entryId":"46607","definition":"非常突出。","pronunciation":["대ː단하다"]},{"id":"2d4b9735cbc26824","term":"부자","zh":"富翁，富豪，富人","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3","entryId":"59725","definition":"财产丰厚、生活富足的人。","pronunciation":["부ː자"]}],"audio":"/audio/dbf05c0b9a162dacfcba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75236-1-4-2","ko":"네, 재산이 일조 원을 넘는다고 들었어요.","zh":"是的，我听说他的财产超过了一万亿韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"재산이","meaning":"财产","explanation":"재산：财产；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재산","audio":"/audio/b1e750976dd682718aac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62097","senseId":"1","lemma":"재산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재산이","audio":"/audio/a4530d7d2cf15db957e9.mp3"}},{"text":"일조","meaning":"一万亿","explanation":"일：一；조：万亿（10¹²）。일조 원 即一万亿韩元。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"},{"term":"조","audio":"/audio/db2f8a944f6cda9e2aff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"75236","senseId":"1","lemma":"조","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일조","audio":"/audio/5d955d85f7840fe63624.mp3"}},{"text":"원을","meaning":"韩元，韩币","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원을","audio":"/audio/ad1782f7421509c2320d.mp3"}},{"text":"넘는다고","meaning":"过，超过","explanation":"넘다：过，超过；는다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"4","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘는다고","audio":"/audio/baabec6a5266d9ca4bbf.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어요.","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어요","audio":"/audio/8c00cca6003a8c8b75f7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"b1e750976dd68271","term":"재산","zh":"财产","audio":"/audio/b1e750976dd682718aac.mp3","entryId":"62097","definition":"个人或团体拥有的钱或可以换钱的东西。","pronunciation":["재산"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31523","definition":"数数时第一个数目。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"db2f8a944f6cda9e","term":"조","zh":"兆","audio":"/audio/db2f8a944f6cda9e2aff.mp3","entryId":"75236","definition":"指一亿的一万倍的数。","pronunciation":["조"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"韩元，韩币","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3","entryId":"27771","definition":"韩国货币单位。","pronunciation":["원"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"过，超过","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"超出一定的标准或限度。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/44ade0c6d3d30e9fd1b3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75236","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.2367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说金会长是个非常有钱的人吧？","是的，我听说他的财产超过了一万亿韩元。","咦？包不是就在旁边吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说金会长是个非常有钱的人吧？","是的，我听说他的财产超过了一万亿韩元。","咦？包不是就在旁边吗？"],"answer":1}]}
